/g><g class="rf-ev"><line x1="740.0" x2="740.0" y1="160" y2="166"/><circle cx="740.0" cy="160" r="8"/><text x="740.0" y="164" text-anchor="middle">7</text><title>1902: The Treaty of Vereeniging ends the Second Boer War and the republic</title></g><text class="rf-axis" x="20" y="200">1854 CE</text><text class="rf-axis" x="740" y="200" text-anchor="end">1902 CE</text></svg><figcaption>Relative power on the Institute's 0–10 scale (each profile scaled to its own peak). Numbers mark the key events below.</figcaption></figure><ol class="rf-events"><li><span class="rf-year">1848</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/britain">Britain</a> defeats <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/boers">Boers</a> under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/andries-pretorius">Andries Pretorius</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-boomplaats">Boomplaats</a> and rules the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/orange-river">Orange River</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sovereignty">Sovereignty</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1854</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bloemfontein-convention">Bloemfontein Convention</a> recognises the independence of the Orange Free State</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1866</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/moshoeshoe-i">Moshoeshoe</a> cedes land west of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caledon-river">Caledon River</a> in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-thaba-bosiu">Treaty of Thaba Bosiu</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1871</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/britain">Britain</a> annexes the diamond fields of Griqualand West</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1897</span><span class="rf-text">Defensive alliance with the South African Republic</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1900</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/